WEBVTT

NOTE Captions aligned to generated speech; sources and audio are independently editable.

p01
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:04.910
OFFICER: Welcome, Captain. Your crew works for
the Merchant Corporation.

p02
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
NARRATOR: Other planets need oil, gold, and
silver to make useful things.

p03
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
OFFICER: Explore this island. Look for ores,
rocks that hold valuable metals.

p04
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
NARRATOR: Trade brings materials for homes, food
shipment, and travel between planets.

p05
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.730
OFFICER: Your discoveries could help the company
earn money, and reveal new materials.

p06
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.930
RHO: I'm Rho, your first mate. Ready, Captain?
Let's explore.

